<p>We documented as we went: 54 dated entries, 52 reviewed pull requests, daily data and a public dashboard, and the entries in our Teams channel, which I coordinated. Outcomes were written when we had data, and marked pending when we did not. AI use is disclosed, and every text was reviewed by us.</p>
